<html class="djot-viewer"><head><meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark"><title>Sanitizing</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Cstyle%3E%40media%20(prefers-color-scheme%3A%20dark)%20%7B%20rect%20%7B%20fill%3A%20%234493f8%3B%20%7D%20%7D%3C%2Fstyle%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2232%22%20height%3D%2232%22%20rx%3D%226%22%20fill%3D%22%230969da%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2216%22%20y%3D%2222%22%20font-family%3D%22Arial%2CHelvetica%2Csans-serif%22%20font-size%3D%2221%22%20font-weight%3D%22bold%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%23fff%22%3Edj%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E"></head><body><main class="djot"><section id="Sanitizing">
<h1>Sanitizing</h1>
<p>An inline image with an event handler: <img src="x"></p>
<p>A <a>javascript: link</a>.</p>

<p>A raw paragraph with an onclick attribute.</p>
<a>A raw javascript: link.</a>
<img src="x"><form></form>
<section id="cookie">A raw section whose id is kept.</section>
<p>Harmless raw HTML is kept: <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>.</p>
</section>
</main></body></html>
